ffective_option_index":1,"solution_verified":true,"render_receipt_id":"flutter-render-v1-20260810","source_fidelity_receipt_id":"source-fidelity-math-0001:nardebam_math_1405_0066","content_patch":null},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0069","subject":"math","topic_key":"patterns_sequences","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","subtopic_key":"patterns_sequences_arithmetic","concept_tags":["arithmetic_progression","right_triangle","pythagorean_theorem","triangle_area"],"prerequisites":["arithmetic_sequences","right_triangle_geometry","quadratic_factoring"],"reviewed_difficulty":"hard","source_sha256":"8506cded62aa3aaa4a4b33443e226759eae7241b548d2cc88662d9dc03fc4f29","runtime_record_sha256":"8506cded62aa3aaa4a4b33443e226759eae7241b548d2cc88662d9dc03fc4f29","effective_record_sha256":"835aca5d41ab24797a21c794e5c56e6a5d8751c4dbb0cca8e0f6509858612f39","source_option_index":2,"effective_option_index":2,"solution_verified":true,"render_receipt_id":"flutter-render-v1-20260810","source_fidelity_receipt_id":"source-repair-math-0002:nardebam_math_1405_0069","content_patch":{"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"روش اول: اضلاع مثلث قائم‌الزاویه را $a$، $b$ و $c$ می‌نامیم که در آن $c$ وتر است. چون اضلاع یک دنبالهٔ حسابی می‌سازند، $b=a+d$ و $c=a+2d$ است.\n$c^2=a^2+b^2 \\Rightarrow (a+2d)^2=a^2+(a+d)^2$\n$\\Rightarrow a^2-2ad-3d^2=0 \\Rightarrow (a+d)(a-3d)=0$\nاز مثبت‌بودن طول اضلاع، $a=-d$ مردود و $a=3d$ پذیرفتنی است. پس اضلاع $3d$، $4d$ و $5d$ هستند.\n$S=\\frac{ab}{2}=\\frac{3d\\times4d}{2}=6d^2=96 \\Rightarrow d^2=16 \\Rightarrow d=4$\n$c=a+2d=3d+2d=5d=20$\nروش دوم: اضلاع هر مثلث قائم‌الزاویه‌ای که دنبالهٔ حسابی بسازند، متناسب با $3k$، $4k$ و $5k$ هستند. بنابراین $\\frac{3k\\times4k}{2}=96$، پس $k=4$ و وتر $5k=20$ است."}]}},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0070","subject":"math","topic_key":"patterns_sequences","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","subtopic_key":"patterns_sequences_arithmetic","concept_tags":["arithmetic_sequence","general_term"],"prerequisites":["linear_equations"],"reviewed_difficulty":"above_average","source_sha256":"7b5ca149396c0974fab9a4dfc768089c47ca83eecd419c7bb1d194a56caf9fd7","runtime_record_sha256":"7b5ca149396c0974fab9a4dfc768089c47ca83eecd419c7bb1d194a56caf9fd7","effective_record_sha256":"bf706e7c7693fdbc9899b0e7bf81a5ca7f2075d33412c08212a19653241cb53e","source_option_index":1,"effective_option_index":1,"solution_verified":true,"render_receipt_id":"flutter-render-v1-20260810","source_fidelity_receipt_id":"source-repair-math-0001:nardebam_math_1405_0070","content_patch":{"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"اگر بین $-18$ و $a$، هشت واسطه حسابی درج کنیم، جمله اول دنباله $-18$ و جمله دهم، $a$ می‌باشد. در این صورت واسطه ششم جمله هفتم دنباله خواهد بود.\n$t_1 = -18$\n$t_7 = t_1 + 6d = 0 \\Rightarrow -18 + 6d = 0 \\Rightarrow d = 3$\n$a = t_{10} = t_1 + 9d = -18 + 27 = 9$\nتذکر: اگر بین $a$ و $b$، $m$ واسطه حسابی درج شود، قدرنسبت از رابطه $d = \\frac{b - a}{m + 1}$ قابل محاسبه است."}]}},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0071","subject":"math","topic_key":"patterns_sequences","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","subtopic_key":"patterns_sequences_arithmetic","concept_tags":["arithmetic_sequence","general_term"],"prerequisites":["linear_equations"],"reviewed_difficulty":"hard","source_sha256":"db094fc09f43918550ebf7249487e2e5e3ed184cc0c18df19adaaa7f2b355a52","runtime_record_sha256":"db094fc09f43918550ebf7249487e2e5e3ed184cc0c18df19adaaa7f2b355a52","effective_record_sha256":"db094fc09f43918550ebf7249487e2e5e3ed184cc0c18df19adaaa7f2b355a52","source_option_index":2,"effective_option_index":2,"solution_verified":true,"render_receipt_id":"flutter-render-v1-20260810","source_fidelity_receipt_id":"source-fidelity-math-0001:nardebam_math_1405_0071","content_patch":null},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_0072","subject":"math","topic_key":"patterns_sequences","section_id":"math_algebraic_foundations","subtopic_key":"patterns_sequences_arithmetic","concept_tags":["arithmetic_sequence","general_term"],"prerequisite